      "parameters": {
        "resource": "image",
        "prompt": "=Generate a detailed AI image prompt that visually represents the CyberSecurity news in a realistic, authentic, and topic-focused way.\nThe image should look like a real-world scene, not a sci-fi fantasy or overly futuristic concept.\nFocus on credible human settings, real technology, and natural lighting.\nAvoid exaggerated digital effects, glowing holograms, or surreal compositions.\n\nThe goal is to create a photo-realistic and modern visual that clearly illustrates the essence of the story — how AI agents are transforming CyberSecurity — showing realistic people, workplaces, or systems in action.\nThe image should feel believable, professional, and relevant to today’s technology landscape, helping viewers instantly grasp the concept.\n\n\n{{ $json.message.content }}",
